163
00:09:06,493 --> 00:09:08,437
We have to find a way
to rescue the hostages

164
00:09:08,520 --> 00:09:10,932
and make sure that none of them get hurt.

165
00:09:11,420 --> 00:09:13,596
They're being guarded by the Vegiemon.

166
