247
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:46,517
She thinks I'm a disgusting,
worthless piece of dirt.

248
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:48,537
I've never seen David so depressed.

249
00:12:48,620 --> 00:12:50,091
I've got to cheer him up.

250
00:12:51,040 --> 00:12:52,540
