something, we could climb down.

255
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,150
No problem.

256
00:13:02,233 --> 00:13:03,277
I'll go look for one.

257
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,617
Wait, we'll be the rope.

258
00:13:04,700 --> 00:13:07,497
We'll just hang on to each other and
